 | `男，老年，高音调` |\n| `female, young adult, 高音调` | 中英文混用 | 全中文或全英文 |\n| `男,中年,低音调` | 用了英文逗号 | `男，中年，低音调` |\n\n---\n\n> 💡 **提示**：不指定方言/口音时，模型使用默认标准发音。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "-", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [809.5823974609375, 1173.9610595703125], "pos": [-417.33660888671875, 3719.24462890625], "id": 36, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "links": [63], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [244.103515625, 464], "pos": [2185.541748046875, 3748.439453125], "widgets_values": ["OmniVoice-bf16", "[Speaker_1]: Hello, I'm speaker one.\n[Speaker_2]: And I'm speaker two!", 32, 1, 0.3, "auto", "auto", "auto", 126114110, "randomize", true, "3", "", "", ""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 61, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "label": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "steps"}, {"widget": {"name": "speed"}, "name": "speed", "label": "speed", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "speed"}, {"widget": {"name": "pause_between_speakers"}, "name": "pause_between_speakers", "label": "pause_between_speakers", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "pause_between_speakers"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}, {"widget": {"name": "dtype"}, "name": "dtype", "label": "dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "dtype"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention"}, "name": "attention", "label": "attention", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_load