 187.94810485839844], "pos": [2103.287841796875, 4296.744140625], "widgets_values": ["[紫薇]", "[Speaker_1]:", "[包拯]", "[Speaker_2]:", "[猴哥]", "[Speaker_3]:"], "inputs": [{"name": "prompt", "link": 56, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "find1"}, "shape": 7, "name": "find1", "label": "find1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "find1"}, {"widget": {"name": "replace1"}, "shape": 7, "name": "replace1", "label": "replace1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "replace1"}, {"widget": {"name": "find2"}, "shape": 7, "name": "find2", "label": "find2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "find2"}, {"widget": {"name": "replace2"}, "shape": 7, "name": "replace2", "label": "replace2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "replace2"}, {"widget": {"name": "find3"}, "shape": 7, "name": "find3", "label": "find3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "find3"}, {"widget": {"name": "replace3"}, "shape": 7, "name": "replace3", "label": "replace3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "replace3"}], "flags": {}, "id": 44, "type": "YC_textReplaceNode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "YC_textReplaceNode"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [56], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [455.0719909667969, 393.5386962890625], "pos": [2504.333251953125, 4123.48681640625], "widgets_values": ["[紫薇] 山无棱，天地合，乃敢与君绝。\n\n[包拯] 停。紫薇姑娘，本府先问你，你可曾在雪山救过一只狐狸？\n\n[紫薇] 狐狸？没有啊。不过尔康去长沙了，说是去买酱板鸭。\n\n[猴哥] 嘿嘿，包黑炭，听见没？酱板鸭。跟你这张脸一个色号。\n\n[包拯] 泼猴住口。本府这是月牙胎记，不是酱板鸭。\n\n[猴哥] 得了吧，你往长沙街头一站，酱板鸭老板都得喊你一声爹。\n\n[紫薇] 别吵了。说出来你们不信，尔康买的酱板鸭，活了。\n\n[包拯] 活了？酱板鸭活了？\n\n[猴哥] 俺老孙活了五百年，头一回听说酱板鸭能活。\n\n[紫薇] 真的。尔康发消息说，酱板鸭半夜从冰箱里爬出来，正满屋子溜达呢。\n\n[包拯] 岂有此理。本府审过诈尸案、还魂案，酱板鸭复活案头一回接。\n\n[猴哥] 嘿嘿，包黑炭，这案子你得带上俺老孙。万一是妖怪变的呢。\n\n[紫薇] 尔康说酱板鸭一边溜达一边喊，山无棱，天地合。\n\n[包拯] 完了，这酱板鸭跟你学的。\n\n[猴哥] 哈哈哈，紫薇你把酱板鸭都带跑偏了。\n\n[紫薇] 才不是。酱板鸭还喊了第二句，包大人，你的脸怎么比我黑。\n\n[包拯] 放肆。本府要亲自去长沙，铡了这只酱板鸭。\n\n[猴哥] 别别别，铡了多可惜，留着当宠物呗。会吟诗的酱板鸭，稀罕货。\n\n[紫薇] 大圣说得对。包大人，要不你认它当干儿子吧，反正颜色也配。\n\n[包拯] 紫薇姑娘，你是猴子请来的逗比吗？\n\n[猴哥] 你是猴子请来的逗比吗？\n\n[紫薇] 我才是。我不光逗，我还给酱板鸭当红娘呢。\n\n[包拯] 结案。紫薇姑娘与酱板鸭同罪，当个事儿办。\n\n[猴哥] 俺老孙去也，去长沙看活酱板鸭喽。\n\n[紫薇] 喂，带上我，我也想看。\n\n[包拯] 都给本府站住。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 45, "type": "YC_SingleTextNode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "YC_SingleTextNode"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [], "size": [270, 112], "pos": [1204.400390625, 3768.72412109375], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 38, "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 31, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "links": [19, 38], "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [468.0063781738281, 512.2073974609375], "pos": [709.9146728515625, 3751.5654296875], "widgets_values": ["OmniVoice-bf16", "唉吔，搞邊科呀？今日天氣鬼咁正，走，落街耍下，整返啲絲娃娃、戀愛豆腐果嘆下嘛！我哋貴州啲小食先叫一絕㗎，係咪先", "男，老年，高音调", 32, 1, 0, "auto", "auto", "auto", 85, "fixed", false], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "voice_instruct"}, "name": "voice_instruct", "label": "voice_instruct", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "voice_instruct"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "label": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "steps"}, {"widget": {"name": "speed"}, "name": "speed", "label": "speed", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "speed"}, {"w